<%doc>

=head1 NAME

sgn_data.mas - SGN page for organism data overview in a tree format

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>
    $organism_trees
</%args>

<& /util/import_javascript.mas, classes => ["CXGN.Page.FormattingHelpers"] &>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title=> "SGN 數據概覽(SGN data overview)" &>

<script language="javascript" type="text/javascript" src="/js/popup.js"></script>

<div class="page_introduction">
  此頁面展示 SGN 上目前所有可用數據的摘要（依物種排序）。點擊物種名稱可查看其可用地圖、基因座、基因庫、EST、代謝註解及表型鑑定材料的詳細資訊。(This page presents a summary of all currently available data on SGN sorted by species. Click a species name for details about available maps, loci, libraries, ESTs, metabolic annotation and phenotyped accessions.)
</div>

% for my $category (reverse sort keys %$organism_trees) {
%    my $organism_tree = $organism_trees->{$category};

   <&| /page/info_section.mas,
     title         => $category,
     subtitle      => '點擊物種名稱以查看更多詳細資訊(click on an organism name to see more details)',
     empty_message => '樹狀圖不可用(Tree not available)',
     collapsible   => 1,
     collapsed     => 0,
     &>

     <& /organism/tree.mas, organism_tree => $organism_tree &>

   </&>

% }
